{"seq":2,"slug":"pcb-design","title":"PCB 设计","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design","rating":{"composite":4.03,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.18,"verdict":"skip-for-this-profile","uScore":1.75}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"pcb-设计\">PCB 设计</h1><p>PCB（Printed Circuit Board，印制电路板）设计是将电路原理图转化为可制造物理电路板的完整工程过程。从元器件选型与原理图绘制，到布局布线、信号完整性分析，再到制造工艺与测试验证，PCB 设计涵盖了电子产品从概念到量产的核心环节。</p>\n<p>本 Hub 系统梳理 PCB 设计的四大知识领域：原理图基础、布局布线、信号完整性与电源完整性、制造与测试。内容覆盖从入门级双层板到高速多层板（HDI）的设计方法论，结合 IPC 标准规范与 2026 年工业界最新实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识结构\">知识结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[PCB 设计] --&gt; B[原理图基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[布局与布线]&#10;    A --&gt; D[信号完整性]&#10;    A --&gt; E[制造与测试]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[元器件符号与封装]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[绘制规范]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[层次化设计]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[布局原则]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[走线与铜皮]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[多层板设计]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[阻抗控制]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[高速信号走线]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[电源完整性]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[DFM 规范]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[制造工艺]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[测试与调试]\">graph TD\n    A[PCB 设计] --&gt; B[原理图基础]\n    A --&gt; C[布局与布线]\n    A --&gt; D[信号完整性]\n    A --&gt; E[制造与测试]\n    B --&gt; B1[元器件符号与封装]\n    B --&gt; B2[绘制规范]\n    B --&gt; B3[层次化设计]\n    C --&gt; C1[布局原则]\n    C --&gt; C2[走线与铜皮]\n    C --&gt; C3[多层板设计]\n    D --&gt; D1[阻抗控制]\n    D --&gt; D2[高速信号走线]\n    D --&gt; D3[电源完整性]\n    E --&gt; E1[DFM 规范]\n    E --&gt; E2[制造工艺]\n    E --&gt; E3[测试与调试]</pre><h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一阶段</td>\n<td>原理图基础</td>\n<td>掌握元器件库管理、原理图规范绘制、层次化设计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二阶段</td>\n<td>布局与布线</td>\n<td>掌握组件放置策略、走线规则、多层板叠层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三阶段</td>\n<td>信号完整性</td>\n<td>理解阻抗匹配、串扰抑制、电源分配网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第四阶段</td>\n<td>制造与测试</td>\n<td>掌握 DFM/DFT 规范、工艺流程、调试方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基础电路分析（欧姆定律、KVL/KCL）</li>\n<li>电子元器件基础（电阻、电容、电感、半导体）</li>\n<li>EDA 工具基本操作（KiCad / Altium Designer / Cadence）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"schematic-fundamentals","title":"原理图基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"component-symbols-footprints","title":"元器件符号与封装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/component-symbols-footprints"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schematic-drawing-standards","title":"原理图绘制规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/schematic-drawing-standards"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hierarchical-design","title":"层次化设计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/hierarchical-design"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"layout-routing","title":"布局与布线","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pcb-layout-principles","title":"PCB 布局原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/pcb-layout-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-strategies-copper","title":"走线策略与铜皮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/routing-strategies-copper"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multilayer-board-design","title":"多层板设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/layout-routing/multilayer-board-design"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"signal-integrity-pcb","title":"信号完整性与电源完整性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"impedance-control","title":"阻抗控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/impedance-control"},{"seq":2,"slug":"high-speed-signal-routing","title":"高速信号走线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/